    "### Final Model Training Visualization\n",
    "\n",
    "Training convergence for the P6-A deployment model is shown in @fig-p6a-results. The model trained on 1'832 images (P1–P53 minus P11) and converged at epoch 607 (early stopping, patience=50).\n",
    "\n",
    "![Training curves for the P6-A final deployment model. Panels show box loss, classification loss, and DFL loss for training and validation splits; precision, recall, mAP50, and mAP50-95 across epochs.](figures/p6a_results.png){#fig-p6a-results}\n",
    "\n",
    "The normalized confusion matrix at best.pt is shown in @fig-p6a-confusion-norm. Evaluated on the validation split (15% of training data). The raw numbers are visible in @fig-p6a-confusion.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "![Normalized confusion matrix for P6-A (best.pt, evaluated on the val split). Rows are predicted classes; columns are ground-truth classes.](figures/p6a_confusion_matrix_normalized.png){#fig-p6a-confusion-norm width=90%}\n",
